{
  "__comment": "Grafana dashboard JSON for the wakir-persona-engine Phase-3c welle-status surface (Noa Bergstroem / SRE, Tag-30 Mini-Welle, extended Tag-31 Mini-Welle for Welle-3 high-frequency telemetry). Consumes Prometheus gauges produced by scripts/phase-3c-welle-status-emitter.py (general welle status) and scripts/welle-3-telemetry-emitter.py (Welle-3 solo cutover high-frequency telemetry, ADR-0066 Mitigation-2). The dashboard is the operator's per-welle live view across the seven ADR-0065 / ADR-0066 cutover welles: pre_cutover, in_cutover, post_cutover, rollback_active, welle_complete. Schema version targets Grafana 10.x (schemaVersion >= 38). Welle-1+2 KW 24, Welle-3 KW 25 solo, Welle-4+5 KW 26, Welle-6+7 KW 27. The doppel_welle_cap row turns red when welle_aktiv_count > 2 (ADR-0066 parallelitaet-cap). The cross_modul_drift panel turns red on a Phase-2-Acceptance-Gate cross_modul_pin_status=fail. The Welle-3 row (panels 41-46) shows the bridge_audit_writer self-consistency score on 10s tick alongside the independent Phase-2 cross-modul stress-test oracle; divergence > 0.5pp raises a red-flag tile (ADR-0066 Welle-3 immediate-rollback trigger per Henrik / Internal Audit caution).",
  "title": "Wakir Persona-Engine - Phase-3c Welle Status",
  "uid": "wakir-persona-engine-phase-3c-welle-status",
  "tags": ["wakir", "persona-engine", "sre", "phase-3c", "welle-status", "adr-0065", "adr-0066", "tag-30", "tag-31", "welle-3-telemetry"],
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "version": 2,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-12h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "1m",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "welle",
        "label": "Welle",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prom"},
        "query": "label_values(persona_engine_phase_3c_welle_state, welle)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "multi": true
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Marathon Progress + Welle-Aktiv Cap",
      "gridPos": {"h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0},
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "gauge",
      "title": "Marathon Progress (welles complete / 7)",
      "description": "Percent of welles in welle_complete state across the seven ADR-0065 cutover steps. Hits 100% only after Welle-7 (recovery_workflow) soak passes. Updated by scripts/phase-3c-welle-status-emitter.py on the deployment's textfile-collector interval.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 1},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prom"},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "persona_engine_phase_3c_marathon_progress_pct",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "marathon progress"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showThresholdLabels": false,
        "showThresholdMarkers": true,
        "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"]}
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"color": "red", "value": null},
              {"color": "yellow", "value": 14.3},
              {"color": "green", "value": 71.5}
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Welle-Aktiv Count vs. Doppel-Welle Cap",
      "description": "Welles currently in_cutover OR rollback_active. ADR-0066 caps this at 2 for doppel-welle weeks (KW 24, 26, 27). KW 25 is bridge_audit_writer solo. Red threshold = 3 (cap exceeded).",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 1},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prom"},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "persona_engine_phase_3c_welle_aktiv_count",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "welle aktiv"
        },
        {
          "expr": "persona_engine_phase_3c_doppel_welle_cap",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "doppel-welle cap"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"]}
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"color": "green", "value": null},
              {"color": "yellow", "value": 2},
              {"color": "red", "value": 3}
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Cross-Modul-Drift (Phase-2-Acceptance-Gate)",
      "description": "Cross-modul-pin-status from the Phase-2-Acceptance-Gate output. Green = cross_modul_pin_status=pass; Yellow = skipped or output missing; Red = cross_modul_pin_status=fail. Red here is an automatic doppel-welle rollback trigger per ADR-0066 Mitigation-1.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 1},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prom"},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "persona_engine_phase_3c_cross_modul_drift{status=\"red\"}",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "drift=red"
        },
        {
          "expr": "persona_engine_phase_3c_cross_modul_drift{status=\"yellow\"}",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "drift=yellow"
        },
        {
          "expr": "persona_engine_phase_3c_cross_modul_drift{status=\"green\"}",
          "refId": "C",
          "legendFormat": "drift=green"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"]}
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"color": "green", "value": null},
              {"color": "yellow", "value": 0.5},
              {"color": "red", "value": 1}
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {"id": "byFrameRefID", "options": "A"},
            "properties": [
              {"id": "thresholds", "value": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "green", "value": null}, {"color": "red", "value": 1}]}}
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {"id": "byFrameRefID", "options": "B"},
            "properties": [
              {"id": "thresholds", "value": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "green", "value": null}, {"color": "yellow", "value": 1}]}}
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 110,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Per-Welle Status (1..7)",
      "gridPos": {"h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 9},
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Welle-1 - v907_verify (KW 24)",
      "description": "Welle-1 lifecycle state (pre/in/post/rollback/complete). Operator-hand-advanced via the lifecycle JSON. Doppel mit Welle-2.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 10},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prom"},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "persona_engine_phase_3c_welle_state{welle=\"1\"} == 1",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{state}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "name",
        "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "/^state$/"}
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "mappings": [
            {"type": "value", "options": {"pre_cutover": {"color": "blue", "index": 0}, "in_cutover": {"color": "yellow", "index": 1}, "post_cutover": {"color": "purple", "index": 2}, "rollback_active": {"color": "red", "index": 3}, "welle_complete": {"color": "green", "index": 4}}}
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Welle-2 - svid_workload_identity (KW 24)",
      "description": "Welle-2 lifecycle. Doppel mit Welle-1.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 10},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prom"},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "persona_engine_phase_3c_welle_state{welle=\"2\"} == 1",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{state}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
